     <td style="padding-top:0in;padding-left:0.042in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0.042in;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The </span><span style="font-size:8pt;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_4f565b8c-15cc-44a5-adb9-49e39310e989" contextRef="C_d1601c24-926e-4e3f-a2ee-797be6ba1814" name="dei:SecurityExchangeName" format="ixt-sec:exchnameen"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Nasdaq</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;Stock Market LLC</span></p><p style="font-size:8pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(NASDAQ Capital Market)</span></p></td>
