e-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">against its net deferred tax asset balance as of March 31, 2026 and March 31, 2025, respectively, due to the uncertainty of its realization value in the future. For fiscal</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p></ix:continuation></div></div>
